# Roomscale — environment configuration
#
# All AI/async features run with built-in MOCKS by default — no keys required.
# Provide a key below ONLY to enable the real Claude-backed LLM spec parser
# (Furniture → Describe tab). Without it, a regex fallback parser is used.
#
# NOTE: a browser-exposed key (VITE_*) is for LOCAL DEV ONLY. In production,
# proxy Anthropic calls through a backend and never ship the key to the client.
VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
